{"unit_id":"RestRegular__dsh-filekit#card-1","repo":"RestRegular/dsh-filekit","commit":"f0ea4f64f24b047defd2d16463eb2233f012c670","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-filekit 是一款面向 DSH 网页客户端的工作区文件管理插件。它扩展右侧工作区文件页，并提供独立文件管理页和编辑器标签，也向 Agent 注册 filekit 工具。用户可浏览目录、创建和编辑文本文件、重命名、复制或移动文件，并把删除内容放入可恢复回收站。界面支持拖拽、右键操作、路径引用和编辑设置，适合在 DSH 会话中整理项目文件。它通过同一套文件操作服务支持侧栏与 Agent；无需额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:455-510","client.js:3865-3967","lib/filekit.js:193-226"]}
{"unit_id":"RestRegular__dsh-filekit#card-2","repo":"RestRegular/dsh-filekit","commit":"f0ea4f64f24b047defd2d16463eb2233f012c670","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-filekit manages workspace files in the DSH web sidebar. It adds a file manager, editor tabs, and an Agent tool for browsing, creating, editing, moving, and copying files. Deleted items go to a recoverable workspace trash folder. It needs no API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:455-510","client.js:3865-3967","lib/filekit.js:193-226"]}
