{"unit_id":"RestRegular__dsh-filekit#feature-1","repo":"RestRegular/dsh-filekit","commit":"f0ea4f64f24b047defd2d16463eb2233f012c670","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-filekit 的功能「浏览与整理文件」：右侧工作区页和独立 FileKit 页可浏览目录并通过菜单或拖拽新建、重命名、复制、移动文件和文件夹。界面操作调用 Host 共享的工作区文件操作。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:3865-3957","index.js:230-310","lib/filekit.js:193-226"]}
