{"unit_id":"RestRegular__dsh-filekit#caveat-1","repo":"RestRegular/dsh-filekit","commit":"f0ea4f64f24b047defd2d16463eb2233f012c670","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-filekit 的界面设置保存在浏览器 localStorage，按浏览器和设备分别生效；默认开启隐藏文件显示、删除确认和 Agent 变更提醒。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:395-402","client.js:418-429"]}
